[x] dashboard /verify-email route spin for every even when backend request respond with 200
    - 1st attempt (dashboard #11, merged) was INCOMPLETE — still spun in dev. REAL root cause: confirm ran as a
      useMutation in useEffect; React StrictMode's dev double-mount drops the mutation result -> stuck spinner
      (it only worked in prod builds, which masked it). FIXED 2026-06-19 in dashboard #12 (PR OPEN): model the
      confirm as a keyed useQuery (StrictMode-safe) + missing-key shows error. Verified live w/ StrictMode on:
      bad/missing key -> error, real mailpit link -> success (POST 200).
    - SHIPPED + VERIFIED ON STAGING 2026-06-19 (meta #90, deploy-staging green): bad key -> terminal error
      ("link is invalid or has expired" + sign-in link), no infinite spinner. CLOSED.
