[x] email verification url not valid in production
    - cause: FRONTEND_URL defaults to app.kaleem.localhost (dev); DJANGO_FRONTEND_URL not set on the VPS, so prod
      emails link to localhost. FIXED: backend #19 requires DJANGO_FRONTEND_URL in production (fail-loud, no
      localhost fallback); #21 passed a build-only value to Dockerfile collectstatic; DJANGO_FRONTEND_URL set on
      the VPS. DONE 2026-06-19: shipped via meta #90 (deploy-staging green), staging healthy.
